'''Cat Slave Chocolate''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by clearing [[A King Imprisoned By Penguins]] during the [[Chocolate Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.7 Update#Update 8.7.5|Version 8.7.5]] increases its chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies.

